1
00:00:22,860 --> 00:00:28,120
♪I scaled sheer cliffs for lingzhi,
then found you gathering moonlight♪

2
00:00:28,920 --> 00:00:33,420
♪Two baskets of silver glow
rang out like stone against steel♪

3
00:00:33,810 --> 00:00:37,100
♪You said to cure me of my hesitation♪

4
00:00:37,100 --> 00:00:39,930
♪I'd need nine measures
of wind from the cliffs♪

5
00:00:40,160 --> 00:00:45,280
♪And three measures of a heartbeat
that stops when our eyes meet♪

6
00:00:46,560 --> 00:00:49,900
♪I caught your wrist and said♪

7
00:00:49,900 --> 00:00:54,450
♪This condition is already beyond cure♪

8
00:00:54,460 --> 00:00:56,860
=Hanyi Enters The Heart=

9
00:00:56,860 --> 00:00:59,780
=Episode 14=

10
00:01:00,620 --> 00:01:01,230
Your Majesty.

11
00:01:01,790 --> 00:01:03,910
All the witnesses and evidence are here.

12
00:01:04,790 --> 00:01:06,260
I beg Your Majesty to investigate.

13
00:01:13,830 --> 00:01:14,790
Absurd.

14
00:01:16,310 --> 00:01:18,590
You are utterly shameless, Gu Hanyi.

15
00:01:25,700 --> 00:01:26,990
One madwoman

16
00:01:27,340 --> 00:01:29,390
leading a group of madwomen

17
00:01:29,390 --> 00:01:31,900
to spout nonsense
before the entire court.

18
00:01:33,980 --> 00:01:35,860
Your Majesty, do not believe them.

19
00:01:37,150 --> 00:01:38,900
This woman is of humble birth.

20
00:01:38,940 --> 00:01:40,620
Who knows who put her up to this?

21
00:01:40,750 --> 00:01:42,830
Yet she dares,
on Your Majesty's imperial birthday,

22
00:01:42,860 --> 00:01:45,070
to make such vicious accusations
before the throne.

23
00:01:45,220 --> 00:01:46,470
She deserves to die for this!

24
00:01:49,500 --> 00:01:52,220
Your Majesty,
have this madwoman seized at once

25
00:01:52,330 --> 00:01:53,640
and sentenced
to the harshest punishment.

26
00:01:55,540 --> 00:01:56,070
Your Majesty.

27
00:01:59,940 --> 00:02:00,390
Your Majesty.

28
00:02:01,390 --> 00:02:03,510
We jointly submit this memorial.

29
00:02:03,950 --> 00:02:06,510
It contains evidence gathered

30
00:02:07,140 --> 00:02:08,940
over many years by Qin Lie,
Marquis Zhongjing,

31
00:02:08,950 --> 00:02:11,980
proving that Cui Hong and his faction
formed cliques for personal gain,

32
00:02:12,390 --> 00:02:13,340
took bribes and perverted the law,

33
00:02:13,750 --> 00:02:15,420
and framed loyal officials.

34
00:02:16,540 --> 00:02:18,030
The handwriting and seals

35
00:02:18,110 --> 00:02:19,060
are all here as proof.

36
00:02:19,540 --> 00:02:21,110
Your Majesty, please examine them.

37
00:02:26,870 --> 00:02:27,980
Forgive us, Your Majesty.

38
00:02:28,830 --> 00:02:31,390
We were coerced by Cui Hong

39
00:02:31,870 --> 00:02:34,060
- into doing things against our conscience.
- Your Majesty.

40
00:02:34,060 --> 00:02:35,260
You... You...

41
00:02:36,700 --> 00:02:38,980
(Cui Hong, you've lost.)

42
00:02:39,620 --> 00:02:41,340
(You thought your rank and power)

43
00:02:41,670 --> 00:02:42,980
(put you beyond anyone's reach,)

44
00:02:42,980 --> 00:02:44,490
(but your countless crimes
have cost you everyone's support.)

45
00:02:45,030 --> 00:02:45,590
Good.

46
00:02:47,590 --> 00:02:50,750
What a fine group
of ungrateful wretches.

47
00:02:52,110 --> 00:02:52,590
Your Majesty.

48
00:02:53,410 --> 00:02:55,050
After a thorough investigation
by the Court of Judicial Review,

49
00:02:55,780 --> 00:02:57,180
we found that the poisoning of Lord Li

50
00:02:57,590 --> 00:02:59,670
at the Noble Consort's birthday banquet

51
00:03:00,180 --> 00:03:03,180
was orchestrated by Grand Secretary Cui.

52
00:03:04,180 --> 00:03:04,830
Your Majesty.

53
00:03:05,350 --> 00:03:06,230
Years ago,

54
00:03:06,580 --> 00:03:08,600
the entire family of Shen Ji,
former Deputy Director

55
00:03:08,600 --> 00:03:09,860
of the Imperial Medical Service,
was murdered.

56
00:03:10,700 --> 00:03:12,230
It was not the work of the bandits.

57
00:03:14,140 --> 00:03:15,390
The man behind the massacre

58
00:03:16,020 --> 00:03:17,110
was Cui Hong.

59
00:03:20,790 --> 00:03:21,670
Shen Ji...

60
00:03:22,140 --> 00:03:23,540
I remember that case.

61
00:03:23,630 --> 00:03:24,740
According to the case records,

62
00:03:25,700 --> 00:03:28,950
the Shen family was attacked
and robbed by bandits

63
00:03:29,020 --> 00:03:30,190
and tragically killed.

64
00:03:30,670 --> 00:03:32,630
Those records were nothing
but lies meant to conceal the truth.

65
00:03:33,420 --> 00:03:33,980
Your Majesty.

66
00:03:34,540 --> 00:03:36,230
All 37 members of the Shen family

67
00:03:36,950 --> 00:03:38,070
were brutally murdered by Cui Hong,

68
00:03:38,420 --> 00:03:39,230
Zhao Wujiu,

69
00:03:39,510 --> 00:03:41,580
and a third accomplice.

70
00:03:42,140 --> 00:03:43,420
They tried to force my father

71
00:03:43,830 --> 00:03:46,420
to hand over the epidemic poison chapter
of The Forbidden Qingnang Formulas.

72
00:03:47,390 --> 00:03:48,910
My father chose death
rather than surrender it.

73
00:03:51,230 --> 00:03:51,830
So they...

74
00:03:53,670 --> 00:03:55,020
they slaughtered

75
00:03:55,980 --> 00:03:57,110
the entire Shen family.

76
00:04:13,350 --> 00:04:14,740
(This court)

77
00:04:14,740 --> 00:04:16,950
(has never been a place
where right and wrong prevail.)

78
00:04:17,740 --> 00:04:19,830
(Those who hold the power)

79
00:04:20,300 --> 00:04:22,420
(are the ones who survive to the end.)

80
00:04:28,140 --> 00:04:29,110
So,

81
00:04:30,700 --> 00:04:33,230
you are the one survivor
of the Shen family.

82
00:04:38,350 --> 00:04:39,830
Now it all makes sense.

83
00:04:40,980 --> 00:04:42,390
You bore a grudge,

84
00:04:43,260 --> 00:04:46,580
so you orchestrated this entire scheme.

85
00:04:48,300 --> 00:04:49,110
Then

86
00:04:49,510 --> 00:04:51,140
you conspired with these traitors

87
00:04:51,700 --> 00:04:53,070
and fabricated evidence

88
00:04:53,190 --> 00:04:55,580
in an attempt to bring me down

89
00:04:55,760 --> 00:04:57,550
and avenge the Shen family.

90
00:05:03,740 --> 00:05:04,460
Your Majesty,

91
00:05:05,070 --> 00:05:06,910
I am innocent.

92
00:05:08,140 --> 00:05:10,020
This woman harbors sinister intentions.

93
00:05:10,790 --> 00:05:12,540
She has framed
a high-ranking court official

94
00:05:14,140 --> 00:05:15,580
and deserves to die.

95
00:05:17,660 --> 00:05:18,190
Your Majesty,

96
00:05:18,870 --> 00:05:21,310
I implore you to see the truth

97
00:05:21,510 --> 00:05:25,750
and have this
wicked woman executed at once

98
00:05:25,900 --> 00:05:27,510
to uphold order in the court.

99
00:05:29,220 --> 00:05:29,900
Cui Hong.

100
00:05:30,750 --> 00:05:32,070
You framed loyal officials,

101
00:05:32,100 --> 00:05:33,100
brought misery upon the people,

102
00:05:33,310 --> 00:05:34,460
and slaughtered the innocent.

103
00:05:34,870 --> 00:05:35,990
The evidence against you is irrefutable.

104
00:05:35,990 --> 00:05:37,050
Your crimes are utterly unforgivable.

105
00:05:38,140 --> 00:05:40,510
Your Majesty, I am innocent!

106
00:05:40,950 --> 00:05:41,580
Guards!

107
00:05:42,660 --> 00:05:44,430
Strip him of his official robes.

108
00:05:44,660 --> 00:05:46,070
Remove his official hat.

109
00:05:46,460 --> 00:05:47,750
Throw him into death row.

110
00:05:49,340 --> 00:05:50,990
All his accomplices
involved in these crimes

111
00:05:51,220 --> 00:05:52,750
are to be imprisoned as well.

112
00:05:54,550 --> 00:05:56,510
Interrogate them thoroughly.

113
00:05:56,870 --> 00:05:58,510
Not a single one is to be overlooked.

114
00:05:59,390 --> 00:06:01,630
Your Majesty, I am innocent!

115
00:06:06,700 --> 00:06:07,900
(Father once said,)

116
00:06:08,870 --> 00:06:11,870
(Medicine can enter the veins,
and words can reach the ears,)

117
00:06:13,020 --> 00:06:16,260
(but only justice can reach the heart.)

118
00:06:17,830 --> 00:06:19,340
(So this is the power
of the people's hearts.)

119
00:06:21,430 --> 00:06:23,630
(For ten years,
I held the court in check,)

120
00:06:23,990 --> 00:06:26,140
(controlled the Imperial Medical Service,
and commanded the frontier armies,)

121
00:06:26,390 --> 00:06:28,220
(and made every official
bow to my will.)

122
00:06:29,550 --> 00:06:30,990
(Yet I never imagined)

123
00:06:31,990 --> 00:06:35,700
(that the blade that would kill me
was never in its sheath,)

124
00:06:37,390 --> 00:06:39,070
(but in the hearts of the people.)

125
00:06:48,780 --> 00:06:50,100
(When hearts are united,)

126
00:06:50,760 --> 00:06:51,900
(nothing can stand against them.)

127
00:06:53,780 --> 00:06:56,870
(It is time
to restore order to the court.)

128
00:07:07,460 --> 00:07:08,430
Today,

129
00:07:09,000 --> 00:07:10,660
here in Fengtian Hall,

130
00:07:11,630 --> 00:07:13,430
before all the officials of the court,

131
00:07:14,510 --> 00:07:17,310
I will see justice done
for the Shen family

132
00:07:18,100 --> 00:07:19,580
and restore to you,
a daughter of the Shen family,

133
00:07:19,900 --> 00:07:21,940
the honor and good name
that are rightfully yours.

134
00:07:24,900 --> 00:07:27,660
You have inherited
your father Shen Ji's legacy

135
00:07:28,140 --> 00:07:29,460
and possess exceptional medical skills,

136
00:07:29,830 --> 00:07:31,510
along with a compassionate heart
devoted to helping others.

137
00:07:33,020 --> 00:07:35,430
Now that order
has begun to return to the court,

138
00:07:35,950 --> 00:07:37,190
there is much that remains to be done.

139
00:07:37,950 --> 00:07:38,700
I ask you,

140
00:07:39,510 --> 00:07:41,430
are you willing to use
all that you have learned

141
00:07:41,750 --> 00:07:43,190
to continue serving the court

142
00:07:43,660 --> 00:07:45,020
and the people?

143
00:07:49,190 --> 00:07:50,580
Your Majesty saw the truth

144
00:07:51,550 --> 00:07:52,340
and cleared

145
00:07:52,430 --> 00:07:54,220
both my name and the Shen family's.

146
00:07:54,340 --> 00:07:55,340
You have given me a new life.

147
00:07:57,140 --> 00:07:59,140
Even if I gave my life
in Your Majesty's service,

148
00:07:59,510 --> 00:08:01,430
I could never repay
even a fraction of your great kindness.

149
00:08:04,310 --> 00:08:05,660
I am willing to give everything I have

150
00:08:05,990 --> 00:08:08,190
and devote myself
to my duty until my final breath.

151
00:08:09,390 --> 00:08:09,870
Good.

152
00:08:11,870 --> 00:08:14,020
Shen Li, daughter of Shen Ji,

153
00:08:14,460 --> 00:08:15,260
receive your appointment.

154
00:08:20,510 --> 00:08:22,660
Shen Li is loyal and upright,

155
00:08:22,830 --> 00:08:24,100
and carries on her father's aspirations.

156
00:08:24,340 --> 00:08:25,630
Her medical skill is extraordinary,

157
00:08:26,190 --> 00:08:27,550
and her compassion
brings aid to the people.

158
00:08:28,550 --> 00:08:30,750
During the recent
epidemic around the Capital,

159
00:08:31,020 --> 00:08:33,750
she saved countless lives
and rendered great service to the people.

160
00:08:34,190 --> 00:08:36,870
Today, she also stood fearless
before a powerful traitor,

161
00:08:37,020 --> 00:08:38,390
stepped forward

162
00:08:39,310 --> 00:08:40,630
and presented evidence against Cui Hong,

163
00:08:41,070 --> 00:08:42,190
helping restore order to the court

164
00:08:42,340 --> 00:08:43,580
and rendering
great service to the realm.

165
00:08:44,580 --> 00:08:45,920
I hereby make an exception
and promote you

166
00:08:45,920 --> 00:08:48,220
to Deputy Director
of the Imperial Medical Service,

167
00:08:48,700 --> 00:08:50,220
a position of the fourth rank.

168
00:08:50,550 --> 00:08:52,220
You are granted
the Imperial Physician's Gold Plaque

169
00:08:52,580 --> 00:08:54,700
and placed in charge of all affairs
of the Imperial Medical Service.

170
00:08:55,340 --> 00:08:56,900
I trust you will not disappoint me

171
00:08:57,430 --> 00:08:58,960
or dishonor your father's name.

172
00:09:00,390 --> 00:09:01,550
I, Shen Li,

173
00:09:01,950 --> 00:09:03,070
accept the decree with gratitude.

174
00:09:03,660 --> 00:09:05,340
I will faithfully fulfill my duties

175
00:09:05,510 --> 00:09:06,630
and prove worthy
of Your Majesty's grace.

176
00:09:07,220 --> 00:09:07,870
Shen Li.

177
00:09:09,900 --> 00:09:11,390
I trust you will remember your oath

178
00:09:12,870 --> 00:09:15,100
and always uphold
a physician's compassion.

179
00:09:26,260 --> 00:09:27,990
Hanyi was able
to bring down Cui Hong this time

180
00:09:28,290 --> 00:09:30,290
only because Master was guiding
everything from behind the scenes.

181
00:09:31,700 --> 00:09:33,070
Fire gains strength from the wind,

182
00:09:33,220 --> 00:09:34,380
and the wind feeds the flames,

183
00:09:34,910 --> 00:09:36,380
like a phoenix
soaring through the heavens.

184
00:09:37,500 --> 00:09:39,220
It was Hanyi's own efforts
that brought her this far.

185
00:09:39,850 --> 00:09:41,050
You are very thoughtful, Young Master.

186
00:09:42,030 --> 00:09:43,220
Do you truly feel

187
00:09:43,670 --> 00:09:45,220
nothing more than
a master's affection for Hanyi?

188
00:09:46,500 --> 00:09:47,460
She and I

189
00:09:49,550 --> 00:09:50,700
can only ever be master and apprentice.

190
00:09:52,100 --> 00:09:53,380
Then what about Shen Li?

191
00:09:56,030 --> 00:09:57,220
She is different from all of you.

192
00:09:59,430 --> 00:10:00,500
But every one of you

193
00:10:01,380 --> 00:10:02,910
is just as important to me as she is.

194
00:10:05,430 --> 00:10:08,190
Xiao Jing is using
living people in the army

195
00:10:08,580 --> 00:10:09,580
to create poison soldiers.

196
00:10:09,690 --> 00:10:10,830
Their bodies
are filled with deadly poison,

197
00:10:10,830 --> 00:10:11,980
they move like corpses,

198
00:10:12,170 --> 00:10:13,290
and even blades can barely harm them.

199
00:10:13,950 --> 00:10:15,740
(Using living people
to cultivate poison...)

200
00:10:16,460 --> 00:10:18,030
(You truly treat human lives
like livestock.)

201
00:10:19,150 --> 00:10:19,740
(Xiao Jing,)

202
00:10:21,220 --> 00:10:23,030
(you are bringing
about your own destruction.)

203
00:10:26,220 --> 00:10:26,670
General.

204
00:10:27,550 --> 00:10:28,430
Urgent news from the Capital.

205
00:10:32,580 --> 00:10:34,300
(Cui Hong has been brought to justice)

206
00:10:36,660 --> 00:10:38,220
(Cui Hong has been brought to justice)
Useless fool!

207
00:10:38,400 --> 00:10:39,480
Launch a night raid on the enemy.

208
00:10:40,190 --> 00:10:41,580
Deploy the poison soldiers.

209
00:10:42,550 --> 00:10:43,620
End this battle quickly.

210
00:10:53,580 --> 00:10:54,190
Deputy Director Shen.

211
00:11:03,980 --> 00:11:07,070
Well, if it isn't the newly
appointed Deputy Director Shen.

212
00:11:09,310 --> 00:11:09,950
What is it?

213
00:11:11,150 --> 00:11:12,700
Did you put on those official robes

214
00:11:12,740 --> 00:11:14,830
just to see me off to my death?

215
00:11:15,570 --> 00:11:17,140
The third person
with the man-eating flower

216
00:11:17,140 --> 00:11:18,200
mark on the back of his hand,

217
00:11:18,500 --> 00:11:19,340
who is he?

218
00:11:21,910 --> 00:11:23,150
You truly don't know?

219
00:11:25,070 --> 00:11:26,830
How pathetic.

220
00:11:28,670 --> 00:11:29,830
Stand firm and listen carefully.

221
00:11:30,100 --> 00:11:30,980
I'll tell you.

222
00:11:38,660 --> 00:11:40,340
(Prisoner)

223
00:11:42,380 --> 00:11:45,500
The true mastermind behind
the massacre of the Shen family

224
00:11:45,980 --> 00:11:48,100
was the master who once saved your life,

225
00:11:48,500 --> 00:11:49,830
Xie Yungui.

226
00:12:07,800 --> 00:12:10,660
♪Every step is hard,
every step fraught with danger♪

227
00:12:11,420 --> 00:12:14,360
♪Every step is a battle with no retreat♪

228
00:12:15,020 --> 00:12:17,840
♪As dawn approaches, those still asleep♪

229
00:12:18,690 --> 00:12:21,680
♪Know nothing
of the bitter cold of the long night♪

230
00:12:22,530 --> 00:12:25,850
♪If fate had not woven its threads
and spurred everything along♪

231
00:12:26,190 --> 00:12:29,480
♪How could we witness life's upheavals
and the passing of time?♪

232
00:12:29,830 --> 00:12:36,310
♪If this grand dream is destined to
be absurd, with no answer to be found♪

233
00:12:37,100 --> 00:12:44,190
♪How I wish that when I wake,
I could still be by your side♪

234
00:12:46,690 --> 00:12:54,540
♪However distant the past,
however far the future♪

235
00:12:54,840 --> 00:12:56,650
♪I stand here today♪

236
00:12:56,790 --> 00:13:01,300
♪Unable to turn back,
with no shore in sight♪

237
00:13:01,300 --> 00:13:08,790
♪Between black and white, once a piece
is placed, there is no regret♪

238
00:13:09,430 --> 00:13:10,720
♪You stepped into the game yourself♪

239
00:13:10,720 --> 00:13:13,120
♪Shielding me from hidden arrows♪

240
00:13:13,560 --> 00:13:20,410
♪Leaving me to a lifetime of solitude♪
